WHAT YOU MAY NOT DO
-------------------

You may not redistribute this source code, or binaries built from it, in
whole or in substantial part, without written permission. That includes
mirroring the repository, publishing builds, and bundling it into another
distribution or mod pack.

Reporting a problem, or sending someone a link to the original repository,
is always fine.


NO WARRANTY
-----------

Provided "as is", without warranty of any kind. This software modifies a
game client by injecting code into it. You run it at your own risk.


